## Two programs that have no P-code build

Their source does not build, so a P-code build of them does not exist:

- `vb6-code/Edge-detection/Edge_Detection.exe`: its project file names
  `cCommonDialog.cls`, which is not in its directory.
- `vb6-code/Hidden-Markov-model/HMM.exe`: `frmHMM.frx` is damaged upstream,
  as `corpus/NOTICES` says.

A repair would invent source, so neither is repaired.
